summary: within a Cortex-M0 image, net.parse_ip reads an IPv4 address, a compressed IPv6 address and a link-local one with its zone as the addresses their constructors and net.with_zone make, telling two zones and none apart, and refuses an empty zone, a zone after an IPv4 address and a three-part IPv4 address as invalid_address; runtime/network-addresses-written-firmware writes them, runtime/network-addresses holds every form on the hosted targets
